---
title: Scheduled Tasks Subsystem
---
flowchart LR
    Person([Person<br/>iMessage or web]) --> Chat["/chat turn]
    Chat --> Router[Routing model<br/>schedule_task · manage_tasks<br/>decided with every other tool]
    Router -->|schedule_task| Save[ConversationService<br/>_apply_task_action]
    Router -->|manage_tasks| Save
    Locality[(Primary locality<br/>timezone)] --> Save
    Save -->|which task they mean| Picker[Routing model<br/>pick_task]
    Save --> Tasks[(scheduled_tasks<br/>instruction encrypted · cadence · next_run_at)]
    Save --> Outcome[task_outcome context<br/>+ reply/task_outcome block]
    Outcome --> Reply[Reply model<br/>words the confirmation]
    Reply --> Person

    Loop[Discovery worker process<br/>task loop] -->|enqueue due slots| Tasks
    Tasks --> Runs[(scheduled_task_runs<br/>one per slot · leased claim)]
    Runs -->|claim| Runner[TaskRunner]
    Runner -->|bearer as the person<br/>task conversation · scheduled_task mark| Fire["/chat turn<br/>+ reply/scheduled_task block]
    Fire --> Turn[TurnResult<br/>reply · images · rendered diagrams]
    Turn -->|channel imessage| Bridge[Mac iMessage bridge<br/>bubbles and attachments]
    Bridge --> Person
    Turn -->|channel web| Runs
    Runner -->|finish: delivered · completed · failed| Runs

